Package: climatech
Title: Download, Summarize and Plot Weather Station Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mora", "Vilar", , "moravilaraustral@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Maria del Pilar", "Castro", , "mdpc010407@gmail.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Read weather station data from a URL, by default data from
    stations of the National Institute of Agricultural Technology (INTA)
    available in the Agricultural Information and Management System (SIGA).
    It includes functions to summarize any numeric variable of one or more
    stations and to plot its monthly average. It also provides sample data
    to explore and test the package's functions.
License: `use_mit_license()`, `use_gpl3_license()` or friends to pick a
    license
